  <metadata>
    <id>keepass-plugin-keeanywhere</id>
    <title>KeePass Plugin KeeAnywhere</title>
    <version>2.3.0</version>
    <authors>Daniel Bölts</authors>
    <owners>Kyrodan</owners>
    <summary>Plugin for KeePass 2.x to to add support for cloud storage providers</summary>
    <description>
KeeAnywhere is a KeePass plugin that provides access to cloud storage providers (cloud drives). The main goal is to offer a simple UI while integrating deeply into KeePass. This covers all kind of users: novices, experienced and power users.

Supported providers:

* Amazon AWS S3 (and compatible)
* Azure (Blob and File Storage)
* Box
* Dropbox
* Google Drive
* Google Cloud Storage
* HiDrive
* OneDrive
    </description>
